{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:37 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:11 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:11 2026-10-26 HKT</p><p>中環地標商廈怡和大廈外，今日（10月26日）下午6時許，有吊船故障墜落地面，兩名工人被困半空，依靠安全繩保命，並站在不同樓層的圓窗外待救。消防接報後趕至，兩名「飛將軍」從天台游繩而下分別救援。</p><img alt=\"兩名工人在不同樓層待救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d51d2605d61a45daa4adb07ebaee2f78/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_08_34_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防飛將軍救援較上層一名工人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1b7d6a1ddbf5be157602067043e3014/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_08_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"另一工人等待救援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b73110b5cd23802d85597d3cbdfeced/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_08_36_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"另一名消防飛將軍救援較下層工人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5ddeaf939d083b2708cf3b5723ef7cc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_20_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"另一名消防飛將軍救援較下層工人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1033f2252e60713d7ab6f1f547cbf88d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_08_33.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，消防在場嚴陣以待，在地面張起氣墊以防萬一；警方亦協助封鎖附近行人路，避免途人靠近；不少市民和旅客在場仰望圍觀，相當緊張，見消防成功解救後才鬆一口氣，紛紛說「落緊嚟啦」。目前意外原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"故障墜落的吊船。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a96cf34bf5ea99f5c6ee6d211624dfb9/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-26-19h30m23s071.png\"/><img alt=\"現場為中環怡和大廈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d768d73fd47b746b3ef3c37f69f0d94f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_22_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為中環怡和大廈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b86873343128d392104dcadaa5e1d15b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_31_02.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防開氣墊戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fe0d3b3c0197394e8a41154421f9a767/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_31_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批市民緊張圍觀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7f584615f7a7cc0abbb8447ea668243a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_19_31_01_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:31.360743+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:37:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:21.715535+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:21.715535+00:00","content_hash":"c127c2ea5eba5d81ff21181a9be6c1ac2f80f0630b73ad0c7ad9d9423ded6df3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}